"""Paper 2 · Unit 7 · P2-U7-03 Software Requirements (1 × 30), P2-U7-04 Software Design (2 × 30) and P2-U7-05 Software Testing (2 × 30).
References: Pressman, Software Engineering – A Practitioner's Approach (chs. 5–15, 17–23); Sommerville; IEEE Std 830 (SRS), 829 (test
documentation); Gamma et al., Design Patterns. Each set mixes REAL previous-year questions (exact wording, printed option order,
`source`) with new ones. Official answers: KEA final keys for Legislative Council Secretariat 2024 (Computer Operator P2, Junior Console
Operator P2 – booklet A1) and GTTC 2024 (Lecturer CS – A1). KSET questions come from packs/pyq-p2.json (answers worked out by ExamSim).
Cyclomatic complexity, mutation score, defect density and availability numbers checked by computation."""
